---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<Layout
  title="The Artist | KING CRAFT ARTS"
  description="Meet Ronald Takunda Chaparadza, the artist behind KING CRAFT ARTS."
>
  <section class="shell py-16 sm:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">The artist</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl font-display text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-7xl">
      Ronald Takunda Chaparadza
    </h1>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-24">
      <div class="relative flex aspect-[4/3] items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-earth/20 bg-earth/5 px-8 text-center">
        <div class="absolute inset-[12%] rounded-[45%_55%_50%_50%/55%_45%_55%_45%] border border-earth/30" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-[28%] rounded-full border-2 border-gold/70" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="relative max-w-xs text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-earth">
          Artist photograph to be added when confirmed
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-ink/75">
        <p>
          {site.artist} makes bags as a way to express art through his hands. KING CRAFT ARTS is the space where that work can be seen, considered and discussed directly.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-6">
          Each style is presented with the information currently confirmed for it. The collection is a starting point for finding a form that speaks to you, whether you are exploring an available piece or asking about a made-to-order option.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-7 text-ink/65">
          The public artist location is {site.location}. Personal background and additional practice details will be added here when they are confirmed.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a
            href="/gallery/"
            class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center rounded-full bg-earth px-6 text-sm font-semibold text-cream transition-colors hover:bg-ochre focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-gold"
          >
            View the collection
          </a>
          <a
            href="/custom/"
            class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center rounded-full border border-earth/40 px-6 text-sm font-semibold text-earth transition-colors hover:border-ochre hover:bg-earth/5 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-gold"
          >
            Explore custom orders
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-earth/15 bg-earth/5" aria-labelledby="practice-title">
    <div class="shell grid gap-8 py-16 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-24">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The practice</p>
        <h2 id="practice-title" class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
          Made with intention.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-ink/75">
        <p>
          The work begins with the bag style and the conversation around it. Requests are treated as specific enquiries, so details are confirmed rather than assumed.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-6">
          Browse the gallery to see the current styles, then get in touch when you are ready to ask about availability, pricing or a custom direction.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
